[{"client_msg_id":"f60017b9-de1e-40a7-b13a-b6bb98e87676","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Fern にて、何個かのアクションに `=` バージョンを追加します。コレを使うことで、マッピング段階でデフォルト値を与えることができるようになります。\n\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/pull/352\u003e","ts":"1625304306.122200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/pull/352|#352 Add `=` action variants to several actions for providing default value\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/pull/352|#352 Add `=` action variants to several actions for providing default value\u003e","text":"With this PR, users can provide mappings with default value like:\n\n```\nnmap \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-action-dirdiff) \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-action-ex=)DirDiff\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n```\n\nAbove add `dirdiff` action which execute \u003chttps://github.com/will133/vim-dirdiff|`:DirDiff`\u003e command on marked file scheme nodes.\n\nKapture.2021-07-03.at.18.23.52.mp4","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim|lambdalisue/fern.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1625303557}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":4,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ","U9S4G0LJW","U01AQ5BFNLX","U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vtpPa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"557f3799-27c2-4e14-a249-2e6131a79027","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Fern に `diff` と `ex` アクションを追加します\n\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/pull/351\u003e","ts":"1625304060.121500","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/pull/351|#351 Add `diff` and `ex` actions\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/pull/351|#351 Add `diff` and `ex` actions\u003e","text":"*`diff`*\n\nUsers can use `diff` action to compare buffer contents of mu